// Cloudflare Workers static assets: no Worker code, `dist/` is served as it is.
// The hostname is NOT here: it is SITE_HOST in the repo-root .env (see scripts/deploy.mjs),
// so it can change without a code edit. Deploy with `task deploy` from the repo root (CI gate first).
// Migration from the Pages project (README, Deploy):
// 1. deploy with SITE_HOST unset and check the `workers.dev` URL;
// 2. remove the custom domain from the Pages project (Cloudflare dashboard);
// 3. set SITE_HOST=kaucrow.dev and deploy again.
{
  "name": "kaucrow",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-06",
  "assets": { "directory": "./dist" },
}
